# Commerce

Browser calls **`/api/medusa`**, not Railway.

- Client: `frontend/src/lib/medusa-v2.ts`
- Proxy: `frontend/src/pages/api/medusa/[...path].ts`
- Pay now: Stripe Payment Element. Intent amount from Medusa cart total.
- After Stripe succeeds: verify PI server-side, then complete Medusa with `pp_system_default` and `metadata.paid_via=stripe`. Railway has no Stripe provider.

Do not add Shopify or JotForm. Do not go back to pay-at-pickup as the default.

```ts
// ❌ BAD — browser → Railway
fetch(`${PUBLIC_MEDUSA_BACKEND_URL}/store/carts`, { credentials: "include" })

// ✅ GOOD — browser → same origin
fetch(`/api/medusa/store/carts`, { credentials: "include" })
```
